<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-1b96b26053cb94c1090f7287daaa83ab356ba5ce356bad1d5779596042654496">
  
    

  
  

          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/28/08/010" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">28.08.010  General.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>(Amended by Ordinances 181437, <a href="https://efiles.portlandoregon.gov/record/15844599">191154</a>, <span>and </span><a href="https://efiles.portlandoregon.gov/record/17150613"><span>192002</span></a><span>, effective January 10, 2025.)</span></p></div></div>



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>All plumbing installations must be designed and installed in accordance with the Oregon Plumbing Specialty Code, any other relevant Specialty Codes, Title 25 and this Chapter.&nbsp;Permits and inspections are required for all plumbing work except as specifically exempted by this Title.</span></p><p><span>Existing plumbing that was lawfully in place in Portland as of January 1, 2008, or that was constructed or relocated under a valid permit after that date is considered an existing nonconforming condition as provided in this Title.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-bacd75c845342c1afd009782dddfd828b26b7803816e9659aa7c0d571bae5d87">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-a70594709d8237bb4ea8983c42c77c49daa581cdee4565e235fbf85d27ad7982">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
