  <h2>Terms and policies</h2>
  

        
                <ul class="menu menu--level-1">
                    <li class="menu-item">
        <a href="/311/ada-request" title="Request accommodations under the Americans with Disabilities Act" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/25709">ADA accommodation</a>
              </li>
                <li class="menu-item">
        <a href="/help/about/captioning-and-transcription-policy" title="Policies regarding the captioning and transcription of video and audio" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/569">Captioning and transcription</a>
